<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103605" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρ-ήρης</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς</span>) ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quadrireme</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				600
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.47.5
			</span></i> (a model of one, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				1432
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ab</u>
				 ii 55
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>); acc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρήρην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1628.49
				</span></i>
			, al.; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήρη</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1629.272
			</span></i>, <u>Inscr.Délos</u> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.47.7
			</span></i>; gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1629.705
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήρους</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				628
			</span></i>, al.; also 
				Dor.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήρευς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					4.178.10
				</span></i>
			 (Cedreae, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>):—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρ-ηρικὰ</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῖα,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρήρεις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.10.5
			</span></i>; and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρ-ηρῑτικός</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1629.685
			</span></i>.</div>
